00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.500
Ah-huh.
Right there.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.500
So we haven't talked a whole lot.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.150
Yeah.
Because we're like,

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.273
