00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.120
How's your Mythicon Rhett?

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.773
Well, I just took some Pepto.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.540
I mean, I'm doing great.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.220
I also just took some Pepto.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:09.660
Yeah, I saw that.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:10.890
I went up to Jenna

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:14.790
and she was in kind of a
group of people I leaned in,

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:17.517
and said, "Can you gimme some Pepto?"

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.430
What's happening for you down there?

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:24.330
Well, hopefully nothing,
and that's why I took Pepto.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:29.330
But then, when you see somebody
taking pills, do you just...

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:30.270
That's not a good habit,

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.590
