00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.887
then say, "Well, can I
have some of those pills?"

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:36.120
'Cause that's what happened.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:40.443
Well, when I saw that you were chewing it,

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.960
I was like, "Oh, it's a chewable."

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.040
Yeah.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.630
Well, that's really my jam.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.013
You have a thing-

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.203
I love to chew.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.690
Well, but also you have a thing

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:56.070
where you don't really know
when a pill is a chewable,

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:58.461
or a, what's the alternative, swallowable?

00:01:58.461 --> 00:01:59.550
Swallowable.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.710
Swallowable?
Yeah.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:02.940
And I've tried to explain this,

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:05.400
that typically the flat discs are chewable

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.100
and the capsules are swallowable.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.793
Right, but I'm pretty sure
you can chew everything.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.820
If you try hard enough, yeah.

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:17.040
I mean, when it goes to your stomach,

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:20.103
it's like your stomach chews it.

00:02:24.015 --> 00:02:25.467
I don't know, I feel like I'm
really getting the most out of

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:29.703
whatever I'm consuming
if I actually chew it.

00:02:30.698 --> 00:02:32.283
That's why I chew pudding.

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:36.420
But no, I mean, I can see

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.890
that you're concerned about my stomach,

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.800
but it's totally fine, and
Link's is very much fine.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.130
'Cause he's just taking
preventative Pepto-Bismol

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.040
at this point.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.810
It's great, a little bit doesn't hurt.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.493
And I think it makes your poops-

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:49.620
Real dark-
Purple.

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:50.610
Yeah, real dark.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:51.780
Makes your tongue dark.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.160
It's like the color of your jacket.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.920
Hey, later on tonight
on our main stage show,

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.440
we can both stick out our black tongues,

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.740
because that's what happens
when you put that bismuth,

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.750
whatever the active ingredient is.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.375
Now?
No, not yet, you gotta wait.

00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:07.080
Okay.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.820
Congrats on the show last night,

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:09.916
James and his Shame was awesome.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.500
That was a lot of fun.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.713
Almost too much fun
all at once, too early.

