didn't want to show me up

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:02.070
and he didn't want me to show him up.

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:03.630
Right, right, yeah.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:07.650
He kind of stole your thunder
