for the next hour or so,

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.523
I don't have any barbecue sauce.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.290
I'm not gonna do any
dancing demonstrations.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.810
Man, you got Nancy up there, I love that.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.460
Pretty great.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.603
Pretty great, yeah.

00:04:27.603 --> 00:04:28.770
Is that just-
That was like a thrill?

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:30.450
A typical Friday night for them?

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:31.350
I think so, yeah.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:32.183
I love it.

00:04:33.554 --> 00:04:34.387
It seemed like

00:04:34.387 --> 00:04:36.543
