person would you haunt?

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:17.100
Do you have life insurance
taken out on each other?"

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:17.933
Wow.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:22.290
That's kinda like a hard left turn

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.123
in the middle of this inquiry.

00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:26.823
Well, I can see how that
those might be related.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.040
I like ghosts.
"If you're gonna die,

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.890
who do you wanna haunt

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.010
and does the other person
benefit from your death?"

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:38.190
Is basically the two-part question.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.050
Am I reading this right, Bonnie?

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:43.510
Yes, I mean, basically I like
ghosts, so I have to ask.

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:46.140
And then, also I work in
entertainment production

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.150
