but I'm just curious.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.450
Okay, well let's start
with the ghost part.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.658
You seem like a demented person.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:05:59.980
You're in the right place.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.920
If you were a ghost,

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:08.460
what location item of
person would you haunt?

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:12.750
Well, I mean, first of all,

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:17.750
