00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.663
No, I'm just saying that-

00:06:32.663 --> 00:06:35.910
"Ooh, that one is chewable."

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.290
Yeah, I mean I would definitely do that.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.420
I would give you advice,
but I'm just saying that

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.120
if you didn't want to have
to rethink everything,

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:45.630
it would be simpler for you
if we just continued to be

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.770
a duo, but I was a ghost,

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:50.100
kind of like that Smosh movie
"Ghost Mates", remember that?

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.620
Basically we would just
be following the plot

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:53.490
