00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:58.140
Right, so T-Pain is now involved in this?

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.433
Ah, hopefully, yeah.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.830
Would people see you?

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:05.730
You're not visible.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:08.940
So I would just seem very, very fixated

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.253
