00:07:12.253 --> 00:07:14.250
I think I would function
like a typical ghost,

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.860
which is, I don't know
if it's real or not.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:17.927
And that's what a lot of
people would think about you.

00:07:17.927 --> 00:07:22.927
I think I would just call
you my imaginary friend.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.000
Okay.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.040
Which is not far from reality.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.593
I imagine that you're my friend right now.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:31.497
I don't know how to feel about that.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.210
I mean, do you imagine
that I'm your friend?

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:40.170
I mean, I think, I believe
that you're my friend, Link.

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:43.170
Right, so, but if you
were to think about it

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.310
in an abstract way,

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.440
you'd be imagining our friendship.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.930
And doesn't that make me
your imaginary friend?

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.433
Okay, technically yes.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:54.630
Yeah, we can be each other's
imaginary friend, dude.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.463
But who would you haunt?

00:07:55.463 --> 00:08:00.180
It could be a new aspect
of our relationship.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:02.640
Okay, we can talk about that later.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:03.660
Whether or not we will become

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.223
each other's imaginary friends.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.240
I know that you really
like scaring people.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.073
Oh, I love it, yeah.

00:08:13.073 --> 00:08:15.750
So you really, I hate your question,

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.360
