need to scare somebody.

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:27.420
So it's like, I would
just be the worst ghost.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.020
I think I would definitely
have to possess somebody.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.460
Is that an option?

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.480
Demons can do that.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.770
Oh, demons.
I don't think ghosts...

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.095
You wanna be a demon?

00:08:36.095 --> 00:08:39.063
It's a different question.
Yeah, I'd rather be a demon.

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:43.650
I do think it would be fun though.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.720
Again, I don't really know
what I believe about this,

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.930
but if I died and was suddenly a ghost

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.850
and it was like, "Oh,
that is a real thing."

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:54.030
I think I would haunt
a very popular atheist,

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.368
