like, "Ah, they're real!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.777
Ah, my life's work is ruined."

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:09.960
And then you're like, "It's just me Rhett,

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.430
that guy from the internet."

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:12.667
Yeah.

00:09:12.667 --> 00:09:15.060
"It's started out as a
hypothetical question

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.730
in a live "Ear Biscuit"."

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.304
I don't know why I'm using that voice.

00:09:20.304 --> 00:09:21.660
Is that the voice you would use?

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:25.050
No, I'd probably keep my own voice.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:27.210
I mean, but it would be more ghostly.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.610
Tell me to choose something.

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.360
No, I'm not gonna-
I know you're not my puppet.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:36.243
No, I'm not gonna, you can
imagine that I did that.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:39.250
You're not as cooperative as my dad.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.260
Okay, second part of your question.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:48.260
Yes, we did have an awkward
conversation with the people

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:52.590
