about insurance and such.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:56.250
And we do have an insurance
policy on one another,

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.010
which is pretty-
It's wild.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:09:59.843
Think about it.

00:09:59.843 --> 00:10:01.867
I mean, 'cause you get to a
certain point and you're like,

00:10:01.867 --> 00:10:05.970
"Well, what do we do

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:09.690
if one of us kicks the bucket?

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.490
Or when one of us kicks the bucket?"

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.570
And if it's sooner,

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:14.760
I think the other person gets
more money, I don't know.

