Is that how it works?
I can't remember.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.210
Do we have it on us?

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.163
Let's read the life insurance policy.

00:10:19.163 --> 00:10:20.643
Yeah, I don't have it.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:26.100
There's, yeah, so if
it's, is it one of us?

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.600
Is there anything wrong with talking about

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.770
