00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.660
Well, only-
Of course not.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:31.770
Nothing other than the fact that

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.070
you will almost definitely
be wrong about it.

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.170
Other than that, yeah, it's totally fine.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:40.560
I mean there was, it was
probably like 40 pages

