00:10:42.967 --> 00:10:46.113
"Okay, this is something about if I die,

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:50.547
Christie takes over from me."

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:54.030
Christie.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:56.160
Or she just gets the
money that I would get.

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:57.447
Based on the contract that I read-

