'Cause we didn't want him to miss school.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:45.690
And I was like, "What if
this plane goes down?"

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:47.363
Welcome to my world.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.841
She said, "Welcome to my world."

00:11:51.841 --> 00:11:53.070
The reason we didn't bring it up is just-

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:53.903
You're always thinking that.
I was just thinking

00:11:53.903 --> 00:11:55.410
we didn't want you to think about this,

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:57.270
but basically what would happen,

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.650
and this is what we talked about,

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.710
was Christie would just be in charge.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.693
That's right baby.

