00:55:34.920 --> 00:55:36.153
I do.
Okay.

00:55:37.560 --> 00:55:38.790
Probably The Horseshoe.

00:55:38.790 --> 00:55:40.847
The horse one?
Yeah, sorry.

00:55:40.847 --> 00:55:42.690
It was a little boring.

00:55:42.690 --> 00:55:43.523
Are you-

